# Evolith Core - review routing
#
# Syntax: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
# Later matches win, so the catch-all comes first and specific areas refine it.
#
# NOTE: @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development was VERIFIED against the org
# (`gh api orgs/beyondnetcode/teams`) and confirmed to have access to this
# repository. That check matters: GitHub silently ignores an owner it cannot
# resolve, so a wrong handle here yields no review routing at all while the file
# looks correct. This file first shipped naming `@beyondnetcode/evolith-team`,
# copied from the release workflow's failure notifier - and that team does not
# exist. If the team is renamed, update every entry below together, and verify.

# Default owner for anything not matched more specifically.
*                                   @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development

# Governance surfaces. Changes here alter the rules the rest of the repo obeys.
/reference/core/architecture/adrs/  @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/reference/core/control-center/     @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/AGENTS.md                          @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/AGENTS.es.md                       @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/CONTRIBUTING.es.md                 @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/SECURITY.md                        @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development

# Executable governance: native rules and their Rego counterparts must stay at
# rule-ID parity, so both halves route to the same reviewers.
/src/rulesets/                      @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development

# CI harness and workflows.
/.harness/                          @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/.github/                           @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development

# Executable surfaces.
/src/sdk/cli/                       @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/src/apps/core-api/                 @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/src/apps/agent-runtime-api/        @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/src/packages/core-domain/          @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
/src/packages/mcp-server/           @beyondnetcode/evolith-core-s-development
